                    <div class="mp-erd">
                        <div>
                            <p class="mp-eyebrow">Before the interface came the system</p>
                            <h4>Business rules had to become relationships.</h4>
                            <p>A rider can take many rides. A driver completes many rides, but a ride has no driver until someone accepts it. A payment is created only when a ride is completed, or as a small fee if a rider cancels after a driver accepts. Those rules had to become tables, keys and constraints before they could become screens.</p>
