                            <h3 id="mp-bevos">Bevo’s Tacos Checkout</h3>
                            <p class="mp-proof-sub">A checkout app for an Austin food truck. It prices walk-up and catering orders with different rules: sales tax for walk-up customers, and delivery fees with free-delivery rules for catering.</p>
                            <ul class="mp-facts">
                                <li><b>2</b><span>ORDER TYPES</span></li>
                                <li><b>8.25%</b><span>SALES TAX</span></li>
